        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="RM_DribblingCap"]/description</xpath>
          <value><description>A tall pink-lilac cap that weeps without stopping: a thick, sharp-smelling resin beads at the rim, runs down the stalk and pools around its foot. The resin is a nerve poison strong enough to drop a warg in a few breaths. Gathered with care it tips a single poison dart; gathered carelessly, it is gathered once. Slow to grow, and it can be planted.</description></value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="RM_DribblingCap"]/plant/visualSizeRange</xpath>
          <value><visualSizeRange>8.4~12</visualSizeRange></value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

