        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="RM_Glowstool"]/description</xpath>
          <value><description>A squat brown-grey mushroom that smells like a rag pulled out of a dead animal's stomach. Raw, it tastes the way it smells. Cooked, the stink goes and leaves something rich and savoury behind, and colonists who have eaten one stop complaining about the smell of the patch. Easy to grow in open ground, and it gives a good handful of caps.</description></value>
        </li>
      </operations>
