  <!-- ============== Art landing, 2026-09-20 (ROT_ART_WAVE_1 + ROT_FLORA_FAUNA_VERDICTS_1 STEP 5) ==============
       texPath overrides for the flora defs above whose art has now landed.
       Same PatchOperationConditional gate as the label/size blocks (absent def -> xpath
       doesn't match -> silent no-op). New art lives under this mod's own
       Textures/RotSpecies/<Name>/ , never inside the donor mod's own folder. -->
